  "notes": "Four conflicts recorded in the resource text: (1) evaluation designations under NCF Policy 4.1001 (Fall 2025) supersede the August 2023 Faculty Handbook description; (2) the policy's designation names and the Quick Reference Guide's Banner codes are not mapped to each other by any public source; (3) the Guide's Last Date of Attendance requirement for Unsatisfactory does not appear in the policy; (4) the Handbook's two-course teaching load is described there as an accepted norm, not a college-wide rule. The Honor Code reporting form sits behind the NCF Portal and is not publicly verifiable. Authenticated entry points are deliberately absent from sources[]: docs/integration-contracts.md states a login response cannot count as public verification. Verified 2026-08-31 by anonymous request, every intranet.ncf.edu path tested returned the myNCF login portal and ses.ncf.edu redirected to single sign-on; that boundary is described in the resource prose instead of cited as evidence."
